*
* START-DESCRIPTION:
*
* CALL !SELLRV(direction, index, file, key, list)
*
* SELECTLEFT or SELECTRIGHT (DIRECTION "L" or "R") into a select list variable: the step goes to numbered list 10 and the
* ids are made into LIST as SELECTV makes one.  KEY is the indexed value of the entry found (the SETTING variable, or a
* constant when the statement has none).  STATUS() is the SELECTLEFT's or SELECTRIGHT's: 3030 past the end of the index,
* 3019 for an index the file has not.  List 10 is the scratch select list of this subroutine and what it held is lost.
*
* END-DESCRIPTION
*
* START-CODE

$internal
subroutine sellrv(direction, index, file, key, list)
$catalog !sellrv

   if direction = 'L' then
      selectleft index from file setting key to 10
   end else
      selectright index from file setting key to 10
   end
   st = status()
   items = ''
   loop
      readnext id from 10 else exit
      items<-1> = id
   repeat
   selectv items to list
   set.status st
   return
end

* END-CODE
